 {"type": "describer", "content": " "}, {"type": "example", "content": "I always go to the library after class."}, {"type": "text", "content": "An <span class=\"italic\">adverb </span> is a word that can describe a daily activity.  There are different groups of adverbs. One group of adverbs are called <span class=\"strong\"> adverbs of frequency</span>. They tell you how often something happens. Here are some examples:"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":\"05\",\"columns\":\"02\",\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\"> Adverb</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">How often? </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"always\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"100%\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"usually\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"60%\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"rarely \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"10%\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"never\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"0%\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": " I usually go to the library to study. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "I rarely go to the library before class. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "I never go to the library in the morning. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "I always go to the library in the morning."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "How often ... ?"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to ask how many times you do something"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: How often do you take the bus?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn1le04ob06aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you can use to talk about daily activities."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to return"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to take something back to its place of origin"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I have to return my book to the library."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn1le04ob06aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "next time"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a future occasion"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Next time we go to the movies, you can come."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn1le04ob06aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to exercise"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to do physical activity to be healthy"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I exercise every day."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn1le04ob06aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "Come with me!"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to invite someone to go somewhere with you"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Come with me to the library!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn1le04ob06aud01"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Express information about  daily or weekly routines in a very simple way."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Speaks in English about daily routines with a limited range of vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Completes simple dialogues by the addition or selection of appropriate language according to the communicative functions of this level. "}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Completes simple dialogues by the addition or selection of appropriate language according to the communicative functions of this level. "}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Completes simple dialogues by the addition or selection of appropriate language according to the communicative functions of this level. "}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Completes simple dialogues by the addition or selection of appropriate language according to the communicative functions of this level. "}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Completes simple dialogues by the addition or selection of appropriate language according to the communicative functions of this level. "}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Completes simple dialogues by the addition or selection of appropriate language according to the communicative functions of this level. "}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Completes simple dialogues by the addition or selection of appropriate language according to the communicative functions of this level. "}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn1le04ob06re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Go on the internet. Find a TV show in English. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Listen to the characters."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write down daily activities they do. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write down any times of the day you hear. "}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I listen for daily activities and times of the day. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "I talk about daily activities. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "I use times of the day."}]}], "type": "sena"}